1104
01:30:55,225 --> 01:30:59,425
その他に北海道たらしめる要素がなさすぎて… うわ、待て。
There are too few other elements that make it distinctly Hokkaido... Whoa, wait.

1105
01:30:59,725 --> 01:31:05,725
これ電柱か？ 縦2枚。これ本当に電力会社のプレートか？
Is this a utility pole? Two vertical plates. Is this really a power company plate?

1106
01:31:06,225 --> 01:31:10,725
ちょ、これ分からんのじゃー。ちょっと分かんないが…
I don't really know this! I don't know, but...

1107
01:31:13,225 --> 01:31:16,725
